  <div data-figma-id="419:354" class="d-0d5553460">
    <div data-figma-id="419:355" class="d-90f4dc1b4">
      <p data-figma-id="419:356" class="d-90cdc6f3f">
        THE PREMISE
      </p>
      <div data-figma-id="419:357" class="d-0fd4aeb9d">
        <p class="d-a51b8649d">Every provider promised centimetre accuracy.</p>
        <p class="d-5e4cc55ed">The city told a different story.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div data-figma-id="419:358" class="d-5940f718b">
    <div data-figma-id="419:359" class="d-5f5186964">
      <p data-figma-id="419:360" class="d-29eb4c9eb">
        01 / THE PROBLEM
      </p>
      <div data-figma-id="419:361" class="d-a5676d77a">
        <p class="d-5c1042d65">When a lab result</p>
        <p class="d-8e8be4414">becomes a promise</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div data-figma-id="419:362" class="d-9abded9b1">
      <p data-figma-id="419:363" class="d-97010335f">
        Cyclomedia captures and processes street-level data for cities, utilities and infrastructure
        organisations around the world.
      </p>
      <p data-figma-id="419:364" class="d-97010335f">
        This film examines one of the industry’s most misunderstood claims: positioning accuracy—and
        why a result achieved in controlled conditions can fail between real buildings.
      </p>
      <p data-figma-id="419:365" class="d-8cee58210">
        The problem was not the measurement. It was the promise made from it.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div data-figma-id="419:378" class="d-232230f61">
    <div data-figma-id="419:379" class="d-d08b5ce88">
      <p data-figma-id="I419:379;419:375" class="d-91ca964a1">
        01
      </p>
      <p data-figma-id="I419:379;419:376" class="d-c27a4006b">
        THE CLAIM
      </p>
      <p data-figma-id="I419:379;419:377" class="d-56c569c1e">
        Centimetre-level accuracy, presented as a universal measure of performance.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div data-figma-id="419:383" class="d-d08b5ce88">
      <p data-figma-id="I419:383;419:375" class="d-91ca964a1">
        02
      </p>
      <p data-figma-id="I419:383;419:376" class="d-c27a4006b">
        THE CONFLICT
      </p>
      <p data-figma-id="I419:383;419:377" class="d-56c569c1e">
        Dense streets reflect, interrupt and distort satellite signals before they reach a moving
        vehicle.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div data-figma-id="419:387" class="d-d08b5ce88">
      <p data-figma-id="I419:387;419:375" class="d-91ca964a1">
        03
      </p>
      <p data-figma-id="I419:387;419:376" class="d-c27a4006b">
        THE STORY
      </p>
      <p data-figma-id="I419:387;419:377" class="d-56c569c1e">
        Original competitor and customer research, translated into one clear visual argument anyone
        can understand in sixty seconds.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
